{"id":"word:hebrew:H5739","type":"word","title":"עֵדֶר","subtitle":"H5739 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"an arrangement , i.e. muster (of animals)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עֵדֶר (H5739) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 39 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עֵדֶר (ʻêder) means an arrangement , i.e. muster (of animals) First listed occurrence: 1Sam 17 34."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עֵדֶר","transliteration":"ʻêder","pronunciation":"ay'-der","strong":"H5739","lemmaId":"hebrew:H5739","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["כְּ/עֵ֣דֶר","עֵ֥דֶר","עֲדָרִים֙","עֵ֖דֶר","עֶדְרֵ֥י"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",6],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",4],["HNcmpc",4],["HTd/Ncmpa",4],["HNcmpa",4],["HR/Ncmsc",4],["HR/Ncmpa",2],["HRd/Ncmsa",2],["HR/Td/Ncmsa",1],["HC/Ncmpa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"an arrangement , i.e. muster (of animals)","usage":"drove, flock, herd.","full":"H5739. eder I. עֵ֫דֶר noun masculine Gen 29:2 flock, herd (Late Hebrew id. ; Aramaic עַדְרָא ; on ᵐ5 Γαδερ 35:16 ( = HCT 35:21 ) see Lag BN 76 f. , who assigns ׳ע therefore, plausibly, to III. עדר (), as lagging, loitering ); — ׳ע absolute 32:17 (twice in verse) +, construct Song 4:1 +; suffix עֶדְרוֺ Isa 40:11 +; plural עֲדָרִים Gen 29:2 +, construct עֶדְרֵי Micah 5:7 +, etc.; — 1 flock: a. of sheep , ׳ע צאֹן Gen 29:2 (J), Micah 5:7 , ׳ע ׳הַצ Joel 1:18 ; compare Gen 29:2-3 , 8 ; 30:4 (all J), 1Sam 17:34 ; Jer 51:23 ; Mal 1:14 ; || צאֹן Ezek 34:12 (simile), Prov 27:23 ; + בְּהֵמָה 2Chr 32:28 ; ׳ע הָֽרְחֵלִים Song 6:6 = 4:2 (insert probably ׳הָֽר ); sign of desolation Isa 17:2 ; 32:14 ( ׳ע מִרְעֵה ), Zeph 2:14 ; Jer 6:3 , of peace 31:24 ; in simile also Micah 2:12 ; Jer 31:10 ; Psa 78:52 ; figurative of Israel Isa 40:11 ; Jer 13:20 (|| צאֹן ), ׳ע יהוה 13:17 , so עֶדְרוֺ Zech 10:3 . b. of goats , ׳ע הָעִזִּים Song 4:1 ; 6:5 . c. undefined Judg 5:16 ; Job 24:2 ; Song 1:7 . 2 herds, flocks and herds ; a. including sheep, cattle, etc. , Gen 32:17 (4 t. in verse); 32:20 (compare 32:14 ; all E). b. specifically ׳ע בָקָר Joel 1:18 . &#8212; מִגְדַּלעֵֿדָר see above","rootNote":"from 5737 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Sam 17 34","keyReferences":["1Sam 17 34","2Chr 32 28","Ezek 34 12","Gen 29 2","Gen 29 2","Gen 29 3","Gen 29 8","Gen 30 40"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":39,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Sam 17 34","book":"1Sam","chapter":17,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֵ/הָ/עֵֽדֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Td/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 32 28","book":"2Chr","chapter":32,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/עֲדָרִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"Ezek 34 12","book":"Ezek","chapter":34,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶדְר֜/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Gen 29 2","book":"Gen","chapter":29,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶדְרֵי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"Gen 29 2","book":"Gen","chapter":29,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/עֲדָרִ֑ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"Gen 29 3","book":"Gen","chapter":29,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/עֲדָרִ֗ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"Gen 29 8","book":"Gen","chapter":29,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ֣/עֲדָרִ֔ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"Gen 30 40","book":"Gen","chapter":30,"verse":40,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲדָרִים֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"Gen 32 17","book":"Gen","chapter":32,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵ֥דֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Gen 32 17","book":"Gen","chapter":32,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵ֖דֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Gen 32 17",